  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The ratio of the coefficient of the middle term in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>20</mn></msup></math> and the sum of the coefficients of two middle terms in expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>19</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<u>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</u>.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "In&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math>, if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is even, then the middle term is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;term.<p>So, Coefficient&nbsp;of middle term in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>10</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>20</mn></mmultiscripts></math></p>In&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math>, if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is odd, then the middle term is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;term.<p>So, Sum of Coefficient&nbsp;of two middle terms in</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>19</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>9</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>19</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>10</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>19</mn></mmultiscripts></math></p><p>So required ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>10</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>20</mn></mmultiscripts><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>9</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>19</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>10</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>19</mn></mmultiscripts></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>10</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>20</mn></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>10</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>20</mn></mmultiscripts></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
